<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy &amp; Cookies</h1></div></section>
<section class="section section-cream"><div class="wrap prose narrow-wrap">
  <p>We collect only the information you give us in reservation, contact, comedy booking and advertising forms (such as your name, phone number and email) so the Chill &amp; Bite team can respond to you and manage events.</p>
  <h2>Payments</h2><p>This website never stores card details. Any payment gateway used in future will process payments on its own secure pages.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2><p>We use only an essential session cookie to keep forms secure and staff logged in. No advertising or tracking cookies are set.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2><p>Contact us to correct or delete your information. Reservation details are visible only to authorized event staff; advertisers never get access to guest data.</p>
</div></section>
